WEBVTT

00:35:57.417 --> 00:36:00.684
if on some level
it protects you from other states

00:36:00.708 --> 00:36:02.643
that you experienced as more vulnerable,

00:36:02.667 --> 00:36:03.934
only you can tell me.

00:36:03.958 --> 00:36:07.333
It's like the answer that you're trying
to find from me is in you.

00:36:08.125 --> 00:36:10.184
AG: Well, that is definitely not helpful.

00:36:10.208 --> 00:36:13.101
So we need to work on your giving,

00:36:13.125 --> 00:36:16.226
but no, no, I think that's right.

00:36:16.250 --> 00:36:19.441
And I respect and accept the fact
that you're forcing me to do that.

00:36:19.465 --> 00:36:21.684
I would still prefer
if you told me the answer,

00:36:21.708 --> 00:36:23.768
but I understand the impulse not to.

00:36:23.792 --> 00:36:26.809
EP: No, but it's not just
as in pushing it back on you.

00:36:26.833 --> 00:36:30.851
Do you seriously think
that I know the meaning of giving for you?